{
  "uid": "trial-funnel-v1",
  "title": "Trial Activation Funnel",
  "description": "Trial signup → day-30 activation funnel. Only endpoint metrics are shipped today (anomaly counter at signup, day-30 activation counter at exit). Intermediate funnel stages (tax_id validated, first product created, card added) will populate once the Go collectors from P17 Task 1/Task 3 land. Panels labelled 'placeholder' will render empty until then.",
  "tags": ["subscription", "trial", "growth", "mark8ly"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {"from": "now-30d", "to": "now"},
  "timezone": "",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus"},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Tenant (placeholder)",
        "description": "Placeholder — trial counters have no tenant_id label yet.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "all",
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "all", "value": "all"},
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {"title": "Subscription Health", "url": "/d/subscription-health-v1", "type": "link", "icon": "external link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Webhook Pipeline", "url": "/d/webhook-pipeline-v1", "type": "link", "icon": "external link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Arbitrage Operations", "url": "/d/arbitrage-ops-v1", "type": "link", "icon": "external link", "targetBlank": false}
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Funnel coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Funnel stages:** signup → trialing → tax-id validated → first product created → card added → activated.\n\nOnly two end-points are currently instrumented — the **anomaly counter at signup** and the **day-30 activation counter at exit**. Intermediate stages render empty until the P17 Task 1 collectors (`subscription_tax_id_validated_total`, `subscription_trial_product_created_day_30`, `subscription_card_added_during_trial_total`) land in `internal/metrics/registry.go`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Day-30 activations (cumulative, 30d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "increase(mark8ly_trial_activation_day30_total[30d]).",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(mark8ly_trial_activation_day30_total[30d])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "activated"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short"},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Signup anomaly alerts (30d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "increase(mark8ly_trial_signup_anomaly_alerts_total[30d]) — days in the window where signups tripped the §5.1 anomaly threshold.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 4, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(mark8ly_trial_signup_anomaly_alerts_total[30d])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "anomalies"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 1},
              {"color": "red", "value": 3}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Trial activations — daily rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "subscription:trial_activation_day30:rate1d. Dead-man's switch anchor for NoTrialActivationsFor7d.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 4, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "subscription:trial_activation_day30:rate1d",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "activations/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "ops"},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Signup anomaly — 24h rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "subscription:trial_signup_anomalies:rate24h. Security pager trips when non-zero sustained.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 10, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "subscription:trial_signup_anomalies:rate24h",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "anomalies/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "ops"},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Daily activations — 1d increase",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "increase(mark8ly_trial_activation_day30_total[1d]). Day-over-day activation volume.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 10, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(mark8ly_trial_activation_day30_total[1d])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "activations"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short"},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Placeholder — intermediate funnel stages",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 18, "w": 24, "h": 6},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Stages pending instrumentation\n\n| Stage | Metric expected | Status |\n|-------|-----------------|--------|\n| Trial started | `subscription_state_transitioned_total{from=\"signup\",to=\"trialing\"}` | deferred (P17 T1) |\n| Tax ID validated | `subscription_tax_id_validated_total` | deferred (P17 T1) |\n| First product created | `subscription_trial_product_created_day_30` | deferred (P17 T1) |\n| Card added | `subscription_card_added_during_trial_total` | deferred (P17 T1) |\n| Day-30 activated | `mark8ly_trial_activation_day30_total` | **shipped (P5 Task 14)** |\n\nThis dashboard's `uid` (`trial-funnel-v1`) stays stable so panels can be appended in place once the upstream collectors land."
      }
    }
  ]
}
